    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Eileen Karpman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118014394155498079717/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIr3FYH4e_O_CbJfnJinTSRYYRP9Xn00ZdXG5vgSMv4oR6obQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "This cat cafe is magical. Emma who was working there is a sweetheart and all the cats are precious. Special mention to the owner's grey and white cat Tobby, pronounced Toby. The decor is all cat themed and they also sell all sorts of cute cat merchandise. I am saddened to hear that this special place will soon be closing in a few weeks. It's located in an obscure area and therefore doesn't generate enough business to make it sustainable. I hope it reopens in a new location as I was told it would be. I really love this place and I will be returning next weekend again for my coffee and the beautiful kitties!",
        "time": 1744597106,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jonathan Levey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111165063503588188389/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWEYufjTo9Ul8xfyP8r-g5cyiNyvLxjDRBh9eI9F0sS6KIzZ-Zb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Cafe Cats & Friends is not only a wonderful place to find and adopt a loving kitten or cat, but it’s also an enchanted Cafe where the cakes and cookies are scrumptious, the coffee, hot chocolates and teas are superb and the and the sandwiches are “delish!”\nThe bonus is that the owner/hostess, Anne-Marie is welcoming and attentive!\nPlus… did I mention you can play with the kittens and cats? 🐈🐈‍⬛🐈🐈‍⬛🐈❤️😊  👍\nBravo!\nHighly recommended! ❤️👏🏻✨",
        "time": 1728693182,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "victor",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109458995397495321710/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV24nsxHwNBWhYmSRZJWJ3Gst7w1tAOtXEDdq2LpCV_rgS7OARq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Amazing place! Very nice atmosphere with friendly clients and staff. The cats are adorable and very friendly. The food tastes amazing and has fair prices! Will definitely be back!",
        "time": 1714851011,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shanny Beaudry",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106968777714262098932/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjcrjSMzZKr9_8-HojgqcsTP0tds0wMcZ1RMGqSser58lmMFH3Tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Went with my kids for some quality zoo therapy time. This place is awesome. Staff is beyond nice, nice food options, cats are cute and Jacob and Mango are cuddle bugs. You can play board games, color, paint (small fee). So so worth it!!",
        "time": 1723399722,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benoit Desjardins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108500946561258560844/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGa9zht-lsLz24Hrig3ZLqDNBo9REScQd2cBCoKlvueurc9tVe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very nice and calm cozy place. If you want to relax this would be the place. We were able to pet all the cats and enjoy drinks. There is no push to buy drinks or food (as this would be their source of income). We went during the day so I’m not sure of their customer flow at other times.",
        "time": 1721160441,
        "translated": false
      }
